| Req. ID | Functional Requirement                                                                                                                                                    |
| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| FR-01   | The rover shall receive valid movement commands from authenticated Mission Control operators and execute them.                                                            |
| FR-02   | The rover shall report its current position, battery level, temperature, and communication status to Mission Control.                                                     |
| FR-03   | The system shall reject invalid or unauthorized rover commands.                                                                                                           |
| FR-04   | The rover shall enter Safe Mode within **3 seconds** when battery temperature exceeds the critical threshold or battery capacity falls below the defined emergency level. |
| FR-05   | Mission Control shall receive the execution status of commands sent to the rover.                                                                                         |
| FR-06   | The system shall record all commands and critical rover events with a timestamp and operator ID.                                                                          |
| FR-07   | The system shall detect communication failures between Mission Control and the rover.                                                                                     |
| FR-08   | The rover shall automatically enter a safe state when a critical fault is detected.                                                                                       |
